            "detailed_description": "Square Massacre is a skill based, hardcore top-down shooter. No matter what you are going to do, you will lose. The question is how long you will last before the end.<br>The difficulty of this game increases gradually from &quot;Bbooooooring&quot; to &quot;What a hell, how did i die?&quot;. And you will die. And die again. And again. And again, until you will master your skills to last a little longer.<br><strong>Key features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different enemies that will require different approach.<br>      </li><li>Different types of weapons that will help you to survive.<br>      </li><li>The gradual increase of difficulty that will allow you to improve your skills.<br>      </li><li>Did I mention Hardcore? </li></ul>",
